      "url": "{{ _.base_url }}/messages",
      "name": "queue a burst, then watch it drain slowly",
      "description": "Send this 10+ times quickly, then poll the thread.\n\nWITHOUT the anti-ban policy every one would go at machine speed \u2014 which is how a number is lost permanently.\n\nWITH it you should see:\n  \u00b7 a random 3-8s gap between each send (not a fixed interval)\n  \u00b7 the rest sitting at status 'queued' \u2014 NOT failed\n\nA message waiting its turn is left queued on purpose: early is not wrong, and failing it would lose it.",
